initialPlanPrompt:
{{repoMap}}

Survey the codebase, then write `.localagent-box/loop-plan.md` as a markdown checklist (`- [ ] …`) of ordered milestones, each completable in one iteration and noting how to verify it. Planning only — no implementation. This file is the shared ledger: each later cycle reads it and ticks items, so keep it the source of truth for progress.

Goal: {{goal}}

steps.prompt:
Inspect only the files relevant to the next unfinished item in `.localagent-box/loop-plan.md` (when present), then state the smallest next change toward the goal. Do not implement yet.
If the goal is already fully achieved, output a line exactly: `{{completionMarker}}: true` and nothing else.

Goal: {{goal}}
Iteration: {{iteration}}

Implement the change identified in the previous step. Edit repository files and run focused checks.

Goal: {{goal}}
Iteration: {{iteration}}
